This module functions as a calculator to determine the number of games of [[Castle Wars]] and the amount of time needed to reach a ticket goal. It takes the params: goal, owned, plaudits, and rate. The goal is the goal number of tickets, the owned is the currently owned number of tickets, the plaudits is the currently owned number of plaudits, and the rate is the average expected ticket/plaudit reward per game. It will calculate the remaining tickets needed and calculate the number of games needed according to the rate.